<div data-cgap-sector="Data Centers &amp; Telecom" data-cgap-term="data center"></div><p class="lead">A data center packs more stored energy into one building than most factories: UPS battery strings, switchgear, standby generators with fuel, and fire suppression systems that can discharge with people in the room. Many of the people walking the floor are vendors and contractors who do not know the site.</p><p>These signs are written for the white space and the gray space: UPS rooms and battery racks, electrical rooms and PDUs, generator yards, fire suppression zones, CRAH units and cooling towers, raised floors and cable trays, fiber and laser work, and telecom vaults. They are 8x12 aluminum and mount on doors, racks, cages and walls.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>UPS rooms and battery strings</h3><p>UPS modules, battery racks and battery rooms. 255 signs. Typical spot: Flywheel cabinet doors and DC output termination.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-flywheel-ups-sign-8x12-aluminum">Flywheel UPS</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-ups-output-cable-sign-cgap-w01819-812">UPS Output Cable</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ups-fan-tray-sign-cgap-c02425-812">UPS Fan Tray</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ups-room-door-sign-cgap-n06600-812">UPS Room Door</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Electrical rooms and switchgear</h3><p>Switchgear, PDUs, busway and electrical rooms. 58 signs. Typical spot: On busway joint covers.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-busway-joint-pack-sign-8x12-aluminum">Busway Joint Pack</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-transfer-switches-sign-cgap-w14044-812">Transfer Switches</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ups-output-transformer-sign-cgap-c02020-812">UPS Output Transformer</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ups-input-breaker-sign-cgap-n01415-812">UPS Input Breaker</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Generators and fuel</h3><p>Standby generators, day tanks and fuel deliveries. 33 signs. Typical spot: On the generator enclosure door.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-cell-site-generator-sign-8x12-aluminum">Cell Site Generator</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-generator-belt-tensioner-sign-cgap-w06621-812">Generator Belt Tensioner</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-portable-generator-muffler-sign-cgap-c06331-812">Portable Generator Muffler</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-cev-generator-receptacle-sign-cgap-n16295-812">CEV Generator Receptacle</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Server rooms and racks</h3><p>Server rooms, racks, cages and aisle containment. 36 signs. Typical spot: On the server lift mast.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-server-lift-sign-8x12-aluminum">Server Lift</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-server-hoist-sign-cgap-w14083-812">Server Hoist</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-immersion-server-lift-sign-cgap-c22017-812">Immersion Server Lift</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-server-room-wall-mount-ac-sign-cgap-n15287-812">Server Room Wall-Mount AC</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Cooling units, chillers and towers</h3><p>CRAH units, chillers, cooling towers and aisle containment. 179 signs. Typical spot: CRAH fan section access panels.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-crah-unit-fans-sign-8x12-aluminum">CRAH Unit Fans</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-crah-fans-sign-cgap-w14064-812">Crah Fans</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-crah-filter-bank-sign-cgap-c09362-812">CRAH Filter Bank</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-crah-fan-wall-sign-cgap-n12797-812">CRAH Fan Wall</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Raised floors and cable trays</h3><p>Open floor tiles, overhead trays and cable work. 119 signs. Typical spot: Top and bottom of the ramp.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-raised-floor-ramp-sign-8x12-aluminum">Raised Floor Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cut-raised-floor-tile-sign-cgap-w07418-812">Cut Raised Floor Tile</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-raised-floor-dust-sign-cgap-c19733-812">Raised Floor Dust</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-floor-tile-lifter-sign-cgap-n20470-812">Floor Tile Lifter</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Fiber, lasers and splicing</h3><p>Fiber testing, splicing and laser light sources. 160 signs. Typical spot: On the blower housing beside the cable feed wheels.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/fiber-optic-laser-danger-sign-invisible-regulated-exposure-area-and-eye-protection-for-optical-labs-and-industrial-settings-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Fiber Optic Laser</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-fiber-blower-cable-feed-sign-cgap-w06674-812">Fiber Blower Cable Feed</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fiber-scrap-bin-sign-cgap-c19241-812">Fiber Scrap Bin</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-fiber-cleaver-sign-cgap-n02292-812">Fiber Cleaver</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Telecom vaults, huts and towers</h3><p>Vaults, huts, cabinets and tower sites. 181 signs. Typical spot: On the beach manhole cover.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-beach-manhole-sign-8x12-aluminum">Beach Manhole</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-am-tower-base-bond-sign-cgap-w09820-812">AM Tower Base Bond</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-telecom-vault-lid-sign-cgap-c09495-812">Telecom Vault Lid</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-vault-hot-work-sign-cgap-n15420-812">Vault Hot Work</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs go on a UPS or battery room door?</summary><p>Typical postings cover authorized personnel only, the electrical and chemical hazards from the batteries, no open flames and the PPE required inside. Search &quot;UPS battery room&quot; to see every option by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for generator yards and fuel tanks?</summary><p>Yes, including standby generator, day tank and fuel delivery signs. Search &quot;generator&quot; to see them.</p></details><details><summary>Do you make signs for telecom vaults and huts?</summary><p>Yes, including vault atmosphere testing, attendant and roadside signs. Search &quot;telecom vault&quot;.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs go on a UPS or battery room door?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings cover authorized personnel only, the electrical and chemical hazards from the batteries, no open flames and the PPE required inside. Search \"UPS battery room\" to see every option by install point."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for generator yards and fuel tanks?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including standby generator, day tank and fuel delivery signs. Search \"generator\" to see them."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you make signs for telecom vaults and huts?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including vault atmosphere testing, attendant and roadside signs. Search \"telecom vault\"."}}]}</script>